PROGRAM delivery review

RECORD Facts
  subtotal: integer
  express: boolean

RECORD Decision
  fee: integer

REQUEST assess
  GIVEN facts is Facts
  GIVEN decision is Decision
    fee: 0
  WHEN assess facts into decision
  OUTPUT decision is Decision

WHEN assess <facts> into <decision>
  GIVEN facts is Facts
  AND decision is Decision
  IF facts.subtotal >= 120
    set decision.fee to 0
  ELSE
    set decision.fee to 5
  IF facts.express and decision.fee > 0
    add 10 to decision.fee
